<title>BAHRAIN: Investcorp says 96 net rises to $90.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Investcorp says 96 net rises to $90.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investcorp, an international investment bank, on Sunday reported a record $90.4 million net profit for 1996, up from $70.3 million the previous year.</p>
<p>&quot;Its (Investcorp's) net profit for the year ended December 31, 1996 rose 28.6 percent to a record $90.4 million,&quot; the Bahrain-based bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
